MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The screw-mounted magnets felt like a natural next choice because they could complement my magnetic hooks for removable workshop storage.",
    "The pegboard hooks and bins fit my interest in organizing tools, although I would need to confirm that I have a suitable pegboard before choosing them."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The wire connectors and heat shrink tubing assume a wiring project; buying screws and hooks does not mean I currently need to repair or insulate cables.",
    "The specialized glue, precision blocks, thermometer and outdoor tape serve tasks I have not shown a need for, while the COVID test has no connection to my current workshop shopping."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "The recommendations seem to treat workshop supplies as interchangeable, even though mounting and organizing are different needs from wiring, machining or temperature measurement.",
    "My purchases of hardware assortments seem to have been taken as interest in other bulk supplies, but I only want an assortment when it supports a task I actually have."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My repeated magnetic hook purchases point toward practical ways to attach, hang and organize things, making mounting compatibility more relevant than a broad workshop connection.",
    "I rarely choose something just because it might be useful someday; I need a clear current use and, for items like pegboard hooks, confidence that they fit my setup."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly recognized my interest in mounting and organization but stretched it into unrelated workshop projects."
}
